# Saved latents and rendered output live next to the notebook, but must not be committed: they are
# fully reproducible from the notebook plus the (LABEL, CFG_SCALE, seed) recorded in its Takeaways.
#   results_*.pt      final particles, weights and per-step diagnostics for every lambda in a sweep
#   grid_*.png        decoded sample grid
#   diagnostics_*.png ESS / uniq / mean-f curves
# `run_<jobid>.ipynb` is deliberately NOT ignored -- the executed notebook IS the experiment record,
# matching notebooks/flux_lambda_sweep/.
*.pt
*.pt.tmp
*.png
__pycache__/
